					Trypho
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				14.618d
			</span></i>;= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμύλιος ᾠδή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.53
			</span></i>.</div>
